kosha molecular-bio-varga

  -- cluster for molecular biology: DNA, RNA, gene, codon, nucleotide, protein, enzyme.
  -- molecular biology reads life as information encoded in molecular sequences.
  -- the central dogma: DNA → RNA → Protein.

  "biology-varga-vishesa"
  "subanta-swarupa"

  -- sangati roots
  "krama-swarupa"   -- genetic information IS a krama: ordered sequence of codons
  "sandhi-yukta"    -- base pairing (A-T, G-C) is sandhi: complementary joining
  "niyama-yukta"    -- genetic code, codon table are strict niyama
  "avastha-yukta"   -- gene expression, silencing are avastha transitions
  "viveka-yukta"    -- transcription and translation are acts of viveka: reading the sequence

